{
  "content": "<h1><span translate=\"true\" keyword=\"PurchaseOrders\">Purchase Orders</span> &mdash; <span translate=\"true\" keyword=\"QtyOnOrder\">Qty on order</span></h1><p translate=\"true\" keywords=\"InventoryItem InventoryItems Is Item On PurchaseOrder To ToDate\">The <strong>Quantity on Order</strong> screen displays all <em>inventory items</em> included in a specific <em>purchase order</em>.</p><p translate=\"true\" keywords=\"By Is Item On Rent Status To ToDate\">This screen helps you monitor the fulfillment status of each ordered item by tracking quantities at different stages of the procurement process.</p><p translate=\"true\" keywords=\"And Delivered Is Item Pending To ToDate\">Use this screen to see at a glance which items have been fully delivered and which are still pending.</p><details><summary><span translate=\"true\" keyword=\"InventoryItem\">Inventory Item</span></summary><div><div class=\"my-4\"><div class=\"border rounded p-0.5 pointer-events-none text-sm w-max\"><div class=\"grid grid-cols-[1.25rem_auto_1.25rem] bg-neutral-200 gap-[1px]\"><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 border-t border-t-white\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 font-bold text-neutral-500 text-shadow px-4 py-2 border-t border-t-white\"><span translate=\"true\" keyword=\"InventoryItem\">Inventory Item</span></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 border-t border-t-white\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-50 border-t border-white h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-50 border-t border-white h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-50 border-t border-white h-2\"></div></div></div></div><p translate=\"true\" keywords=\"InventoryItem Is Item On PurchaseOrder To ToDate\">Displays the <em>inventory item</em> that was ordered on this <em>purchase order</em>.</p></div></details><details><summary><span translate=\"true\" keyword=\"QtyOrdered\">Qty Ordered</span></summary><div><div class=\"my-4\"><div class=\"border rounded p-0.5 pointer-events-none text-sm w-max\"><div class=\"grid grid-cols-[1.25rem_auto_1.25rem] bg-neutral-200 gap-[1px]\"><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 border-t border-t-white\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 font-bold text-neutral-500 text-shadow px-4 py-2 border-t border-t-white\"><span translate=\"true\" keyword=\"QtyOrdered\">Qty Ordered</span></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 border-t border-t-white\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-50 border-t border-white h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-50 border-t border-white h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-50 border-t border-white h-2\"></div></div></div></div><p translate=\"true\" keywords=\"Is Item On PurchaseOrder To ToDate Total\">Shows the total quantity of this item that was originally ordered on the <em>purchase order</em>.</p></div></details><details><summary><span translate=\"true\" keyword=\"QtyReceived\">Qty received</span></summary><div><div class=\"my-4\"><div class=\"border rounded p-0.5 pointer-events-none text-sm w-max\"><div class=\"grid grid-cols-[1.25rem_auto_1.25rem] bg-neutral-200 gap-[1px]\"><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 border-t border-t-white\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 font-bold text-neutral-500 text-shadow px-4 py-2 border-t border-t-white\"><span translate=\"true\" keyword=\"QtyReceived\">Qty received</span></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 border-t border-t-white\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-50 border-t border-white h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-50 border-t border-white h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-50 border-t border-white h-2\"></div></div></div></div><p translate=\"true\" keywords=\"Action GoodsReceipt GoodsReceipts On Receipt Receipts Received To ToDate Transaction Transactions View\">Shows the quantity that has been received through <em>goods receipts</em>. Click the quantity to view the detailed receipt transactions.</p></div></details><details><summary><span translate=\"true\" keyword=\"QtyInvoiced\">Qty Invoiced</span></summary><div><div class=\"my-4\"><div class=\"border rounded p-0.5 pointer-events-none text-sm w-max\"><div class=\"grid grid-cols-[1.25rem_auto_1.25rem] bg-neutral-200 gap-[1px]\"><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 border-t border-t-white\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 font-bold text-neutral-500 text-shadow px-4 py-2 border-t border-t-white\"><span translate=\"true\" keyword=\"QtyInvoiced\">Qty Invoiced</span></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 border-t border-t-white\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-50 border-t border-white h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-50 border-t border-white h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-50 border-t border-white h-2\"></div></div></div></div><p translate=\"true\" keywords=\"Action Invoice Invoiced Invoices On PurchaseInvoice PurchaseInvoices To ToDate Transaction Transactions View\">Shows the quantity that has been invoiced through <em>purchase invoices</em>. Click the quantity to view the detailed invoice transactions.</p></div></details><details><summary><span translate=\"true\" keyword=\"QtyReserved\">Qty reserved</span></summary><div><div class=\"my-4\"><div class=\"border rounded p-0.5 pointer-events-none text-sm w-max\"><div class=\"grid grid-cols-[1.25rem_auto_1.25rem] bg-neutral-200 gap-[1px]\"><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 border-t border-t-white\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 font-bold text-neutral-500 text-shadow px-4 py-2 border-t border-t-white\"><span translate=\"true\" keyword=\"QtyReserved\">Qty reserved</span></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 border-t border-t-white\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-50 border-t border-white h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-50 border-t border-white h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-50 border-t border-white h-2\"></div></div></div></div><p translate=\"true\" keywords=\"And Is On Received Remaining\">Shows the remaining quantity that is still on order and has not yet been received. This is calculated as the ordered quantity minus the received quantity.</p></div></details>",
  "key": "purchase-order-qty-on-order"
}
